title: 'spec-msg: fetch protocol and sender archive'
doc:
- audience: Node Operator
  description: Archive and serve outgoing messaging streams with finalized-watermark retention and
    own-chain backfill. Retry missing channel history until served or confirmed.
    Rotate the first archive peer between rounds, so a peer serving only proofs cannot stall
    backfill.
    Prune only channel leaves below the last `up_to` applied by the finalized sender runtime.
    A closed lane can retain its unacknowledged tail.
    Keep sibling payloads and proofs available until sender finality.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-spec-msg
  bump: minor
